+//===---------------------------------------------------------------------===//
+
+INSERTPS can match any insert (extract, imm1), imm2 for 4 x float, and insert
+any number of 0.0 simultaneously.  Currently we only use it for simple
+insertions.
+
+See comments in LowerINSERT_VECTOR_ELT_SSE4.
